{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35885","headline":"春日题陈正字林亭 · 李咸用","name":"春日题陈正字林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周回胜异似仙乡，稍减愁人日月长。\n幕绕虚檐高岫色，镜临危槛小池光。\n丝垂杨柳当风软，玉折含桃倚径香。\n南北近来多少事，数声横笛怨斜阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}